"Retrieves up to 30 recently played songs via the Apple Music API, then adds them to the Listening History review list. Plays are recorded even when FastScrobbler is in the background.\n\nNote: playback timestamps aren’t provided by the API, so FastScrobbler assigns an estimated timestamp when the scrobble is submitted. Songs are recorded regardless of playback duration.\n\nWhen \"Auto-scrobble Listening History\" is off, Recently Played API songs are added to the Listening History review list instead of being submitted automatically." = "通过 Apple Music API 最多获取 30 首最近播放的歌曲，然后将它们添加到播放历史审核列表中。即使 FastScrobbler 在后台运行，播放也会被记录。\n\n注意：播放时间戳并非由该 API 提供，因此 FastScrobbler 会在提交 scrobble 时分配一个估算时间戳。无论播放时长如何，歌曲都会被记录。\n\n当“自动 scrobble 播放历史”关闭时，最近播放 API 的歌曲不会自动提交，而是会添加到播放历史审核列表中。";
